# Live /faction scenes (1.2, owner 2026-11-18: "if they are the best scenes then let's double the number written").
# Each needs a realm news flag and plays only while it is true: a keep under siege ("defending"), the realm's army on an
# enemy keep ("attacking"), a keep or relic just lost or won, Darkness Falls just changed hands. {keep}, {relic} and
# {enemy} are the news's own (AutonomousBotDebates.LiveSlots), so "{keep} is under attack" names the keep that is.
# What a bot says is what the realm can see: the warning, the news, /realm. Nobody claims to be at the keep or to be
# riding there (no "omw"), and nobody counts a zerg they cannot see. The talk versions of the same topics play otherwise.
# New writing; period knowledge from the research brief.

@kind debate

# ======================= Any realm =======================
@realm *

@topic keep_live
@levels 35-50
@needs defending
@scene live_inc_keep
@role B type=NoLifer
@role C type=Daredevil
A: {keep} is under attack! | {enemy} are hitting {keep} | anyone see {keep} flashing? {enemy} are on it
B: how many | anyone know numbers | is it a zerg or one group
A: no idea, nobody out there has said | cant tell, just the warning so far | only the warning, no numbers yet
?C: they always bring a ram for that one | {keep} again, they love that door | of course its {keep}
B: whoever is close, call numbers in faction | if you are near it, say how many | someone near it count them, please
D: casters on the walls, kill the ram crew first | ram crew first, not the tanks around it | stairs and lord room if the door goes
A: keep the lord standing, nothing else matters | lord up, door repaired, thats the whole plan | hold the inner door and they lose interest

@topic keep_live
@levels 35-50
@needs defending
@scene live_door_defense
@role B type=NoLifer
@role C type=Leveler,Explorer
@role D type=Socialite,Crafter
A: {keep} is getting hit, {enemy} at the door | door warning at {keep}, here we go | {enemy} on {keep} again
B: anyone actually there? | who is inside right now | is anyone home at {keep}
C: not me, i would never make it in time | too far out for me, sorry | im nowhere near, someone closer?
B: then whoever is: casters on the walls, melee at the inner door | if you are there, casters up top and everyone else inside
?D: and healers? | where does a healer stand in a defense
B: inside, behind the door, off the walls where archers see you | never on the wall, they shoot healers first
~ 30
A: still flashing | {keep} is still under attack | they are still on it
C: ram crews die fast to a caster on the wall | kill whoever is on the rams | the rams matter, the tanks dont
D: and if the outer door goes, everyone to the lord | if they get in, the lord room is where we stop them
~ 25
B: if it falls we take it back later | worst case it flips and we take it back at prime time | doors fall, doors get retaken
A: not today i hope | fingers crossed | lets hope the guards hold

@topic relic_live
@levels 30-50
@needs relic_lost_recent
@scene live_relic_lost
@role B type=NoLifer
@role C type=*
A: did we just lose {relic}? | {relic} is gone, {enemy} took it | anyone see the warning? {relic} is gone
B: yeah, {enemy} walked it out | gone. nobody was home | saw it, {enemy} have it now
C: we take it back at prime time | it comes back, it always does | this weekend, a proper raid
?A: of course nobody was on | figures | sneaky bastards
B: next time someone watches the relic keep | ten people awake would have stopped that | the guards alone never stop a raid
A: great. just great | ugh | well, now we have a story

@topic relic_live
@levels 30-50
@needs relic_won_recent
@scene live_relic_won
@role B type=Socialite
@role C type=NoLifer
A: we got {relic}! | {relic} is ours, did you see the warning | the relic raid worked, {relic} is ours
B: about time | nice, who led that | gz realm
C: now they come back for it, guard it | they will want it back by tomorrow | enjoy it, they always come back
?D: does it really make a difference | is the bonus worth all that
B: it does, and it makes them angry, which is better | every fight gets a little easier, and they hate it
A: best news in a while | i love this realm | gz to everyone who went

@topic keep_live
@levels 30-50
@needs keep_lost_recent
@scene live_keep_lost
@role B type=NoLifer
@role C type=*
A: lost {keep}, {enemy} have it | {keep} flipped, see the warning? | {enemy} took {keep}
B: was anyone even there | nobody defended? | of course, nobody home
C: guards alone never hold | a keep with no people is just a building | the guards did what they could
?D: does it matter, its one keep | its one keep, relax
C: one keep is how darkness falls goes | it matters for df and for pride | one keep, then two, then df closes
